This document outlines the testing strategy, scope, and acceptance criteria for Sprint 1 Software Engineering project, 
focusing on repository governance, project scaffolding, database connections, 
and base table migrations.

Test Case ID: TC-SM-01
Test Component: Database Instance & Environment Initialization
Test Description: Verify that the primary PostgreSQL/Supabase database instance is successfully provisioned, accessible, and correctly linked via environment configuration variables (DATABASE_URL).
Test Steps:
1.Inspect the backend environment template (.env.example) and local .env configuration to ensure database credentials are defined.
2.Initiate a connection test from the backend database utility module (db.js).
3.Verify that connection parameters resolve correctly without authentication rejections.
Expected Result: The database instance accepts incoming connections from the backend application pool (pg.Pool) without timeout or handshake errors.